WEBVTT

00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:21.333
<i>When I was in fifth grade,</i>
<i>I killed somebody with a gun.</i>

00:00:22.958 --> 00:00:25.917
Hey, you! Get over here
and start packing the money!

00:00:28.458 --> 00:00:31.333
If you don't hurry the hell up,
I'll shoot another one!

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:32.958
I swear I'll shoot!

00:00:45.208 --> 00:00:46.333
You little...

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:51.625
Give it back! Give it back,
you little brat!

00:01:21.458 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>I pulled the trigger three times.</i>

00:01:39.708 --> 00:01:44.792
<i>Ever since that day, just seeing</i>
<i>a photo or footage of a gun</i>

00:01:44.792 --> 00:01:49.458
<i>would be enough to trigger</i>
<i>a PTSD panic attack.</i>

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:06.375
<i>No amount of medication or counseling</i>
<i>could assuage my fears.</i>

00:02:26.667 --> 00:02:28.250
<i>I look awful.</i>

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:35.792
<i>Without a second thought, right now</i>
<i>Take aim at this paradox-ridden world</i>

00:02:35.792 --> 00:02:41.667
<i>And fire with your own two hands</i>

00:02:46.292 --> 00:02:51.917
<i>Thanks to the warmth of your falling tears</i>

00:02:51.917 --> 00:02:57.458
<i>I thought that I'd realized what kindness was</i>

00:02:57.458 --> 00:03:03.292
<i>So why do we keep hurting each other</i>

00:03:03.292 --> 00:03:09.875
<i>And create even more hatred?</i>

00:03:09.875 --> 00:03:15.333
<i>If this pain that grates on me</i>
<i>The strength that I've discovered</i>

00:03:15.333 --> 00:03:22.417
<i>Will someday gently envelop the future</i>

00:03:22.417 --> 00:03:29.167
<i>Without a second thought, right now</i>
<i>Take aim at this paradox-ridden world</i>

00:03:29.167 --> 00:03:33.625
<i>And fire with your own two hands</i>

00:03:33.625 --> 00:03:40.417
<i>Take this sorrow</i>
<i>Drenched with red tears</i>

00:03:40.417 --> 00:03:45.958
<i>And embrace it tenderly</i>

00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:48.542
<i>So that these blasts ringing out</i>

00:03:48.542 --> 00:03:57.917
<i>Will be transformed into the sounds</i>
<i>of a new beginning</i>

00:04:03.958 --> 00:04:08.500
<i>Even after I started high school in Tokyo,</i>
<i>far from my hometown,</i>

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:12.375
<i>it's not as if my circumstances changed.</i>

00:04:12.375 --> 00:04:13.250
Bang!

00:04:13.958 --> 00:04:18.833
<i>I don't regret the fact that</i>
<i>I pulled the trigger to protect my mother.</i>

00:04:19.208 --> 00:04:24.583
<i>But neither can I muster the strength to insist</i>
<i>that that was my best option.</i>

00:04:25.125 --> 00:04:29.750
<i>Despite my state of mind, the person</i>
<i>who led me to the world of Gun Gale Online</i>

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:34.917
<i>was the one friend I'd made</i>
<i>in Tokyo... Kyoji Shinkawa.</i>

00:04:35.792 --> 00:04:37.792
You really are amazing, Asada.

00:04:37.958 --> 00:04:44.250
That's not true. In the last qualifying round,
you made it all the way to the semifinals.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.042
No... It's futile.

00:04:46.042 --> 00:04:50.792
An AGI build can only take you so far,
unless you can score some really rare guns.

00:04:51.167 --> 00:04:53.000
I totally messed up
my stats allotment...

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:57.500
Then you're not playing
in the next BoB, Shinkawa?

00:04:57.833 --> 00:05:00.458
Nope. Even if I played,
there'd be no point.

00:05:01.125 --> 00:05:02.417
Hey... Sorry.

00:05:02.708 --> 00:05:05.333
I've got to get going now...

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.125
Thanks for the tea.

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:15.000
And also... Thank you so much for saving me.
You were cool, you know.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:18.708
I wish I could always be there
to protect you.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:25.125
Uh, listen. Do you want me
to walk you home from school?

00:05:25.125 --> 00:05:27.542
N-No, no, that's all right.

00:05:27.917 --> 00:05:30.958
Because I've got to be stronger, too.

00:05:31.708 --> 00:05:35.292
<i>At the time, it was all I could do</i>
<i>to take care of myself,</i>

00:05:35.292 --> 00:05:39.083
<i>so I never noticed</i>
<i>Kyoji's true feelings for me.</i>

00:05:44.375 --> 00:05:48.417
<i>Once I became the sniper, Sinon, in GGO,</i>

00:05:48.417 --> 00:05:52.083
<i>all I did was seek out the powerful</i>
<i>to take on in battle.</i>

00:05:59.625 --> 00:06:00.458
Next!

00:06:36.292 --> 00:06:39.708
<i>That man has the strength</i>
<i>to smile on the battlefield.</i>

00:06:40.417 --> 00:06:42.542
<i>I'm going to kill that man.</i>
<i>And then I'll also...</i>

00:07:16.625 --> 00:07:21.792
<i>The more powerful Sinon becomes,</i>
<i>the more powerful I can become in the real world.</i>

00:07:22.125 --> 00:07:27.625
<i>That's been my belief as I continue to battle</i>
<i>along with Hécate II</i>.

00:07:30.125 --> 00:07:30.958
The end!

00:08:00.875 --> 00:08:03.125
Yes. It's my first time.

00:08:03.625 --> 00:08:10.250
I'd like to go to a cheap weapons shop,
and also someplace called the Governor's Office...

00:08:12.208 --> 00:08:16.000
<i>On the day of the Bullet of Bullets 3 preliminaries,</i>

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:19.500
<i>I met a player named Kirito.</i>

00:08:21.042 --> 00:08:26.042
<i>Pretending to be a girl...</i>
<i>brandishing a sword in this world of guns...</i>

00:08:26.042 --> 00:08:27.708
<i>He was a really annoying guy...</i>

00:08:28.208 --> 00:08:29.125
No way!

00:08:30.125 --> 00:08:31.125
A guy?

00:08:31.125 --> 00:08:32.583
With that avatar?

00:08:41.292 --> 00:08:42.208
Why, you...

00:08:44.542 --> 00:08:49.833
<i>...but he, too, was carrying</i>
<i>some kind of heavy load as he battled on.</i>

00:08:50.667 --> 00:08:52.500
<i>Just like I was.</i>

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.917
<i>I'm going to hit him. Without fail!</i>

00:09:26.958 --> 00:09:30.042
<i>Does he think he can dodge</i>
<i>my bullets whenever he wants?</i>

00:09:35.792 --> 00:09:37.667
<i>He doesn't want to dodge them?</i>

00:09:42.792 --> 00:09:45.625
Don't... mess with me!

00:10:12.875 --> 00:10:17.208
Tell me why! Is this match against me
that meaningless to you?

00:10:18.542 --> 00:10:22.208
My goal is to compete
in tomorrow's final--that's all.

00:10:23.333 --> 00:10:25.292
I have no reason to fight anymore.

00:10:25.458 --> 00:10:28.042
Then you should just take that gun
and shoot yourself!

00:10:28.042 --> 00:10:31.417
Sure, it's just a VR game,
it's just one match...

00:10:31.958 --> 00:10:34.333
You have every right
to see it that way!

00:10:34.333 --> 00:10:39.125
But don't you dare shove those values
down my throat!

00:10:43.708 --> 00:10:46.875
Sinon, will you give me a chance
to make amends?

00:10:47.083 --> 00:10:49.083
Take me on--right now.

00:11:14.042 --> 00:11:15.917
Okay, here goes!

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.958
<i>No way... That's impossible!</i>

00:12:09.792 --> 00:12:12.000
But I was going for your left leg...

00:12:12.667 --> 00:12:16.083
How could you predict
where I was aiming?

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:19.667
I could see your eye
through your scope lens.

00:12:21.167 --> 00:12:24.042
<i>Did he actually read</i>
<i>the trajectory by sight?</i>

00:12:25.042 --> 00:12:30.750
<i>So powerful... This power of his is above</i>
<i>and beyond the level of a VR game.</i>

00:12:31.542 --> 00:12:36.167
If you're so strong,
what is it that you're afraid of?

00:12:37.875 --> 00:12:41.125
This isn't strength. It's just skill.

00:12:41.458 --> 00:12:47.333
No way. That's a lie! No way could you
slash a Hécate Bullet with just technique.

00:12:47.792 --> 00:12:49.542
You know that as well I do!

00:12:49.542 --> 00:12:52.792
What do you have to do
to gain that kind of strength?

00:12:52.792 --> 00:12:56.792
I... That's what
I'm here to find out...

00:12:57.292 --> 00:12:58.208
If...

00:12:59.083 --> 00:13:04.958
If a shot from that gun could really
kill the player in the real world, too...

00:13:05.583 --> 00:13:11.125
And unless you killed him, you or someone
important to you would be killed instead...

00:13:11.625 --> 00:13:15.417
If that was the case,
then could you still pull the trigger?

00:13:22.417 --> 00:13:26.917
<i>Death Gun took aim at Sinon's strength</i>
<i>that I so firmly believed in...</i>

00:13:26.917 --> 00:13:28.917
<i>...and smashed it to smithereens.</i>

00:13:31.042 --> 00:13:34.458
<i>The Black Star? Type 54?</i>

00:13:43.417 --> 00:13:44.792
<i>That gun...</i>

00:13:46.208 --> 00:13:52.250
<i>Why.... Why now... here...</i>
<i>What's that gun doing here?</i>

00:14:00.042 --> 00:14:03.208
Preparations? For what?

00:14:03.875 --> 00:14:09.750
Right now, at this moment, Death Gun's co-conspirator
has broken into your apartment in the real world,

00:14:09.958 --> 00:14:14.000
and he's watching the live stream,
waiting to see you get shot by that gun...

00:14:14.333 --> 00:14:15.917
That's a possibility.

00:14:21.417 --> 00:14:22.375
No!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.125
I can't take it...
Not something like that!

00:14:41.667 --> 00:14:46.708
Until you get shot with Death Gun's handgun,
the intruder can't do a thing to you.

00:14:47.292 --> 00:14:49.833
That's the agreement those two have.

00:14:50.375 --> 00:14:52.375
But if you were to auto-logout

00:14:52.375 --> 00:14:55.292
and get a look at the intruder's face,
you'd put yourself in danger.

00:15:07.333 --> 00:15:08.958
Tell me what we need to do.

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:11.875
We're going to take out Death Gun.

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:18.917
<i>Hécate II... Please</i>!

00:15:19.125 --> 00:15:21.292
<i>Lend this weak girl your strength.</i>

00:15:21.708 --> 00:15:25.292
<i>The strength to stand up again here,</i>
<i>and take a step forward...</i>

00:15:29.458 --> 00:15:31.083
<i>You've got to focus.</i>

00:15:31.417 --> 00:15:34.042
<i>Feel it... His murderous intent.</i>

00:16:00.417 --> 00:16:01.125
Kirito!

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:18.667
There he is!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:08.583
<i>He's powerful.</i>

00:17:09.333 --> 00:17:10.333
<i>One second...</i>

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:14.667
<i>All I need is one second...</i>
<i>If I can break this rush...</i>

00:17:15.542 --> 00:17:19.500
<i>Kirito is trying to turn his words</i>
<i>into actions right now.</i>

00:17:19.625 --> 00:17:25.542
<i>By stopping with his own two hands the criminal known</i>
<i>as Death Gun, who's still influenced by SAO's darkness.</i>

00:17:26.292 --> 00:17:29.458
<i>The reason Kirito can do that</i>
<i>isn't because he's strong.</i>

00:17:29.833 --> 00:17:33.333
<i>It's because he's accepted his weakness,</i>
<i>and brooded, suffered over it...</i>

00:17:33.542 --> 00:17:36.667
<i>Yet despite all that, he's still trying</i>
<i>to look straight ahead.</i>

00:17:40.083 --> 00:17:42.917
<i>Isn't there... something I can do?</i>

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:52.333
Kirito!

00:17:58.375 --> 00:18:00.792
<i>This Bullet Line attack...</i>

00:18:00.958 --> 00:18:06.750
<i>Fired by Sinon, who poured all her experiences, her</i>
<i>inspiration, every ounce of her fighting spirit into it...</i>

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.417
<i>It's a phantom bullet!</i>

00:18:09.625 --> 00:18:14.042
<i>This last attack! I can't let this</i>
<i>Phantom Bullet go to waste!</i>

00:19:19.458 --> 00:19:20.708
Not yet.

00:19:21.167 --> 00:19:25.750
It's not over. I won't let it end.

00:19:25.958 --> 00:19:29.958
That person... will get you...

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:39.125
No. It's all over, XaXa.

00:19:39.333 --> 00:19:41.750
It won't be long before they zero in
on your accomplice.

00:19:42.083 --> 00:19:46.500
The murder spree by Laughing Coffin
is now over for good.

00:20:18.167 --> 00:20:19.500
It's over, huh?

00:20:19.833 --> 00:20:20.625
Yes.

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:27.208
My name is... Shino Asada.

00:20:29.917 --> 00:20:33.125
We'd better bring this tournament
to an end, too.

00:20:33.792 --> 00:20:35.917
Yes, good idea.

00:20:55.875 --> 00:20:57.292
Asada!

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:01.958
<i>If only I could become powerful in the world</i>
<i>known as Gun Gale Online,</i>

00:21:01.958 --> 00:21:05.875
<i>I thought it would cancel out</i>
<i>my weakness in the real world.</i>

00:21:06.042 --> 00:21:09.958
Asada... Asada... Asada... Asada...

00:21:09.958 --> 00:21:13.167
Asada... Asada... Asada...

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:17.292
<i>But I was wrong about that.</i>

00:21:17.292 --> 00:21:18.667
Run, Sinon!

00:21:28.708 --> 00:21:29.583
D-Don't...

00:21:29.583 --> 00:21:34.958
<i>Sinon and Shino...</i>
<i>They were both one person--me.</i>

00:21:42.667 --> 00:21:48.083
<i>To be able to confront that memory head-on...</i>

00:21:48.083 --> 00:21:50.167
<i>it will probably take me a long time.</i>

00:21:55.125 --> 00:22:00.458
<i>Even so, all I have to do</i>
<i>is take it step by step.</i>

00:22:03.125 --> 00:22:04.250
<i>It's all right.</i>

00:22:07.542 --> 00:22:09.458
<i>Because this world...</i>

00:22:09.458 --> 00:22:14.875
<i>The truth is, it's such</i>
<i>a gentle, warm place.</i>

00:22:17.375 --> 00:22:25.208
<i>I wished so hard to become stronger than ever</i>

00:22:25.208 --> 00:22:29.292
<i>Overcoming my grief</i>

00:22:36.333 --> 00:22:43.500
<i>I've turned my back so many times</i>
<i>On the past that will never change</i>

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:50.917
<i>While hiding the scars</i>
<i>I can never show anyone</i>

00:22:50.917 --> 00:22:58.042
<i>I will embrace all this pain</i>
<i>that has started flooding through me</i>

00:22:58.042 --> 00:23:05.625
<i>I don't need warmth at all</i>
<i>If it will vanish one day</i>

00:23:05.625 --> 00:23:13.542
<i>I wished so hard to become stronger than ever</i>

00:23:13.542 --> 00:23:19.958
<i>Like a lonely star racing across the darkness</i>

00:23:19.958 --> 00:23:27.708
<i>Sunk so deep inside my heart,</i>
<i>I'm so weak and fragile</i>

00:23:27.708 --> 00:23:34.833
<i>I can't put it into words, or even speak out</i>

00:23:34.833 --> 00:23:45.250
<i>I'm just waiting for the light</i>
<i>Trying not to be found by anyone</i>

00:23:47.000 --> 00:23:53.110
Next time: "Queen of the Lake."
